~Other -----------------------------------------------------
Synthetic AVO demonstration well. Shale / Class III gas sand / shale, with a brine sand and a cemented streak below. Carries brine, oil and gas fluid cases (_BR, _OIL, _GAS) substituted offline with Gassmann; the AVO QI toolkit itself performs no fluid substitution. Not real data.
